  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Republic of the Marshall Islands, Federated States of Micronesia and Republic of Palau: Inspiring Women&#x2019;s Advancement through Collective Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender discrimination is a significant barrier in transforming the lives of women and girls in the Compact Nations of the Republic of the Marshall Islands (RMI), the Federated States of Micronesia (FSM) and the Republic of Palau (Palau). The three countries will therefore significantly benefit from a project focusing on women&apos;s empowerment. In response to such a need, the project will contribute towards increased local understanding and demand on removing barriers to gender equality through diplomacy and galvanizing coordinated actions in the RMI, FSM and the Palau.</narrative>
  </description>
